cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BdL, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "BdL (Biological Differential Dynamic Logic: A Formal Verifier of Dynamical Systems using Deductive Proofs for Biological Computing and its Applications)"
abstract: "BdL mechanizes proof rules of differential dynamic logic in Isabelle/HOL on top of the AFP formalization of ordinary differential equations, and applies them to ODE models of biological computers without solving the ODEs."
